  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general internet audience familiar with meme culture, dark humor, and sensationalist content. It targets viewers who understand and engage with internet memes that exploit tragedy for shock value or dark comedy, often without direct targeting of any specific demographic or protected group. The audience is expected to recognize the visual trope of extreme grief and the meme format of juxtaposing tragedy with humor or drama.",
